\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  My God I submit my soul,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 My spirit in Thy hands.
\par With love Thou careth for me,
\par The sake of Thy promise.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. On whom solely I depend
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 For my life's salvation?
\par All souls are Thine for ever
\par My soul also is Thine.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Thou hast given it to me,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And so receive it back.
\par Keep it with Thee for ever,
\par Thou only art mine own.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Since I am destroyed by sin,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Eternal fire suits me
\par But owing to Thy glory,
\par I'm still in life and live.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. With the blood of Thy only Son,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Thou poured on my spirit.
\par My Lord Jesus' Righteousness
\par Will bring me before Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. With the strong wings of my faith
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Shall fly me to heaven,
\par My spirit salvation have
\par In Thine own promised grace.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.   Thou Lord, who art my saviour.
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Even when in my sins
\par Even at the point of my death
\par Thou wilt never leave me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.  Thou art living, Thou loveth me,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Thou hast honoured Thy Word.
\par My Lord, with all my spirit
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0\qj I place into Thy Hands.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

